# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Altium
History/
__Previews/
Project Logs for */
*.SchDocPreview
*.PcbDocPreview
*.PrjPcbStructure
*.log

# Autodesk Eagle
*.b#[0-9]
*.s#[0-9]
*.l#[0-9]
*.epf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
